/Title (This Electricity Bill Generator project demonstrates how basic web technologies can solve real-world problems effectively. Through HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, we implemented conditional logic for slab-based tariff calculations, input validation to ensure data accuracy, and dynamic content rendering to display detailed bill breakdowns. The project reinforces fundamental frontend development concepts including DOM manipulation, event handling, and modular code organization. These skills form the foundation for building more complex web applications. Thank you for your attention. Questions or live demo welcome!)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 214 0 R
>>
